{"story":{"id":"story-edfcc36dba27a8d1","title":{"zh":"[This.ContactCountry.GetName]解释道","en":"The [This.ContactCountry.GetName], Explained"},"category":"society","image":"art/b61641c89734c5beff64.webp","start":"first_contact.376","chapters":1,"nodes":1,"visible":true,"excerpt":{"zh":"我们已经破译出[This.ContactCountry.GetRealName]足够多的语言，现在我们可以与他们进行通讯——并理解他们先前的广播。\n\n似乎[This.ContactCountry.GetSpeciesNamePlural]正如我们所料的那样是一个好战社会，他们以最具威胁的战吼问候我们来测试我们的勇气。幸运的是我们的回应获得了共鸣，我们显然获得了他们的尊重。事实上，他们认为我们作为战士的英武是仅次于他们的。","en":"We have managed to decipher enough of the language used by the civilization we now know to be the [This.ContactCountry.GetRealName] to open communications with them - and to make sense of their earlier broadcasts.\n\nIt seems that - as we suspected - the [This.C"},"navigation":{"order":["first_contact.376"],"tree":[{"id":"first_contact.376","parent":null,"depth":0,"kind":"reading","label":{"zh":"","en":""}}],"links":[]}},"chapters":[{"id":"first_contact.376","title":{"zh":"[This.ContactCountry.GetName]解释道","en":"The [This.ContactCountry.GetName], Explained"},"texts":[{"zh":"我们已经破译出[This.ContactCountry.GetRealName]足够多的语言，现在我们可以与他们进行通讯——并理解他们先前的广播。\n\n似乎[This.ContactCountry.GetSpeciesNamePlural]正如我们所料的那样是一个好战社会，他们以最具威胁的战吼问候我们来测试我们的勇气。幸运的是我们的回应获得了共鸣，我们显然获得了他们的尊重。事实上，他们认为我们作为战士的英武是仅次于他们的。","en":"We have managed to decipher enough of the language used by the civilization we now know to be the [This.ContactCountry.GetRealName] to open communications with them - and to make sense of their earlier broadcasts.\n\nIt seems that - as we suspected - the [This.ContactCountry.GetSpeciesNamePlural] are a warlike society who greeted us with their most fearsome warcry, apparently to test our mettle. Fortunately, our response passed muster and we have apparently managed to earn their respect. Indeed, they seem to consider our prowess as warriors second only to theirs."}],"variants":false,"sections":[],"image":"art/b61641c89734c5beff64.webp","hidden":false,"choices":[{"label":{"zh":"他们是